# Commits and PRs

- Commit with appropriate granularity (prefer ~30–100 lines of meaningful diff per commit when practical).
- Commit message: English one-word prefix + concise Japanese subject (eqmonitor style), e.g. `chore: pnpm 以外のパッケージマネージャを禁止する`
- When creating a PR, title format: `[TOPIC] 概要`
- Do not use `npm` / bare package managers; see package-manager rule.
